Subject: [PATCH v8 6/6] jails/instances/lab-claude: Send and read mail through
 lab-mail
To: Pat Maddox <pat@patmaddox.com>
Cc: lab-devel@p7x.dev
Change-Id: suzylktxoktuuutumqkymvtkzxptyllw

The agent needs to send and read p7x.dev mail without holding the
Fastmail credentials. lab-mail holds them and serves SMTP and IMAP on
loopback, so the client config here carries no secrets.

msmtp sends without a queue, so a refused address or a Fastmail
outage shows up as a non-zero exit the agent can act on, and a
message with a bad recipient goes to no one. mbsync copies the list
mailbox into the home directory and notmuch indexes it under its own
profile, so the agent searches a local index and the lab-devel list
keeps its jj maildir and default profile. The README documents the
commands to fetch and to send.
